{"id":"415b9e19f223c427","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-rpo-well-founded.md","title":"RPO","display":"RPO","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","display":"RPO","label":"56-thm-rpo-well-founded","aliases":["56-thm-rpo-well-founded"],"type":"theorem","depends_on":["[[56-df-recursive-path-order]]","[[56-df-reduction-order]]","[[56-df-well-founded]]"],"source_section":"6.4.3; 6.4.23–6.4.26","source_pages":"211; 220–222","source_ocr_blocks":[232,241,242,243],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"read-and-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"display","html":"RPO"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-rpo-well-founded"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-rpo-well-founded</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eafb5a2123c30027\" href=\"?note=eafb5a2123c30027\" title=\"56-df-recursive-path-order\">56-df-recursive-path-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ea6d0d000271b1cf\" href=\"?note=ea6d0d000271b1cf\" title=\"56-df-reduction-order\">56-df-reduction-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2c18125c091d1dde\" href=\"?note=2c18125c091d1dde\" title=\"56-df-well-founded\">56-df-well-founded</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"6.4.3; 6.4.23–6.4.26"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"211; 220–222"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>232</span><span>241</span><span>242</span><span>243</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"eafb5a2123c30027\" href=\"?note=eafb5a2123c30027\" title=\"56-df-recursive-path-order\">56-df-recursive-path-order</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar}),V,\\succ,\\tau\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar}),V,\\succ,\\tau\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>；假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}(F,\\succ)\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}(F,\\succ)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(&gt;_{\\mathrm{rpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\tau})\n\\land\\mathrm{WF}(T,&gt;_{\\mathrm{rpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\tau}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(&gt;_{\\mathrm{rpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\tau})\n\\land\\mathrm{WF}(T,&gt;_{\\mathrm{rpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\tau}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 6.4.3，性质证明见 Propositions 6.4.23–6.4.26。替换和上下文封闭性由构造阶段归纳得到。良基证明采用最小坏序列：各真子项良基；坏下降不能使用子项分支；函数根因 precedence 良基最终稳定；随后固定 status 在良基子项集上产生不可能的无限下降。已读 pp.220–222 的证明。有限签名不是必要假设；无限签名时 precedence 的良基性必不可少。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.4.3; 6.4.23–6.4.26，印刷页 211; 220–222。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本层提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-recursive-path-order","status":"resolved","id":"eafb5a2123c30027","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-recursive-path-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-reduction-order","status":"resolved","id":"ea6d0d000271b1cf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-reduction-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"2c18125c091d1dde","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-well-founded]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-recursive-path-order","status":"resolved","id":"eafb5a2123c30027","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-recursive-path-order]] 的 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar}),V,\\succ,\\tau$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$；假设 $\\mathrm{WF}(F,\\succ)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar}),V,\\succ,\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}(F,\\succ)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(>_{\\mathrm{rpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\tau})\n\\land\\mathrm{WF}(T,>_{\\mathrm{rpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\tau}).","display":true}],"bytes":1515,"backlinks":[{"id":"a80c063491021827","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-hw-bounded-reduction]] 的记号。取 $N,H\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $H\\ge N+1$。$\\mathrm{Stat}_n$、$>_{\\mathrm{rpo}}^{\\Sigma,V,\\succ,\\tau}$ 和 $\\mathrm{Compatible},\\mathrm{RedOrd},\\mathrm{WF}$ 见 [[56-df-recursive-path-order]] 与 [[56-thm-rpo-well-founded]]；下式以截断签名、precedence及status实例化这些参数。$\\operatorname{ar}_{\\mathrm H}$ 在下列有限层级子签名上取限制；status用上游的多重集编码0。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-219","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-rpo-well-founded.md]]"},{"id":"b8687a62bc9cda64","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"这是 Theorem 6.4.3 对全部字典序 status 的实例，名称对应 Definition 6.4.4；由 [[56-thm-rpo-well-founded]] 直接推出。已读原书对应 RPO 证明，并核对 status 实例化。"}],"outgoing":["eafb5a2123c30027","ea6d0d000271b1cf","2c18125c091d1dde"]}